Description: Statistical analysis, reporting and visualization functions
    developed by the Statistics and Bioinformatics Unit (UEB) of the Vall
    d'Hebron Research Institute (VHIR). The package includes tools for
    descriptive statistics, regression modelling, survival analysis,
    epidemiological studies, biomarker evaluation, data management,
    graphical visualization and reporting. Maintenance and continuous
    development are carried out by the Biomedical Data Intelligence Unit
    (BIDU), Vall d'Hebron Research Institute (VHIR), Vall d'Hebron
    Barcelona Hospital Campus.
